                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Skybags' biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Youth + affordable + trend positioning + VIP Industries parent scale + broad category coverage. Multi-dimensional youth accessory advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new luggage brands compete with Skybags?</h3>
                                        <p>In premium (Mokobara, Nasher Miles, Assembly) yes. In youth-affordable Skybags dominant + hard to displace.</p>
                                        <h3>Is Skybags better positioned than Mokobara / Nasher Miles?</h3>
                                        <p>Different segments. Skybags: youth + affordable + broad. Mokobara / Nasher Miles: premium + accessible-premium + design-forward. Coexist.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest legacy brand sub-brand lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Youth-focused positioning + legacy parent advantages + youth-culture marketing + broad category coverage combined. Legacy + youth-brand hybrid works.</p>
